{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想減重卻被複雜的熱量追蹤工具嚇退？FIT AI 以極簡介面取代繁瑣儀錶板，讓你輕鬆記錄飲食、掌握熱量預算、取得下一餐與運動建議，並清楚看見體重與習慣的變化，適合初次嘗試控制熱量、希望以平靜節奏持續減重的人。原價 US $69.99，現正終生版限時免費，內購同步限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>簡單記錄即可掌握進度</h2>\n<p>FIT AI 把減重流程化繁為簡，開啟後即可看到每日熱量目標、剩餘額度與進度，記錄飲食時不必迷失於數字之中。App 會提供簡單餐點建議與配合當日行程的運動選項，並追蹤體重、習慣與持續度，讓每點小成果都看得見，避開繁複儀錶板帶來的壓力。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-228-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-229-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-230-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-231-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-232-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-233-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Diet &amp; Meal Planner: FIT AI 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，選右上角Lifetime， 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5499\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_5499-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5500\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_5500-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Diet &amp; Meal Planner: FIT AI</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T13:59:33.577342+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":458,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}